<title>JAPAN: Japan Nov imported vehicle sales up 4.1% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Nov imported vehicle sales up 4.1% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Domestic sales of imported vehicles rose 4.1 percent in November from a year earlier to 35,933 units, the Japan Automobile Importers Association (JAIA) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It was the third successive month of year-on-year growth in sales and the highest level ever for that month, surpassing the previous November record of 34,527 marked last year.</p>
