<p>General Motors' November car sales included 1,169 GM-made Cavaliers sold by Toyota. The November total included 1,047 Nissan AD vans made in Mexico, up from six the year before.</p>
<p>Of the November total, sales of vehicles produced by overseas units of Japanese makers totalled 8,302, down 21 percent from a year earlier.</p>
<p>Japan's sales of imported vehicles in January to November totalled 389,466 units, up 11.5 percent from a year earlier.</p>
<p>January-November sales, excluding vehicles made by Japanese makers' overseas units, totalled 304,741 units, up 21.5 percent.</p>
